```ts
try {
  const approval = await approvalsApi.detail(approvalId)
  state.value = hydrateApprovals(state.value, [approval])
  if (approval.status !== 'pending') {
    state.value = clearPendingApproval(state.value, approvalId)
  }
} catch { /* detail 失败至少移除指针 */ state.value = clearPendingApproval(state.value, approvalId) }
await refreshHistory()
```
注意 `hydrateApprovals` 对已决定卡设置 decision 与服务端一致；pending 列表如果 status pending 仍加回（但 409 已决定不应 pending，可能竞态）。若 pending 则保留。

编辑。

